<title>BRAZIL: Daewoo Eletronics to form Brazil venture.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Eletronics to form Brazil venture.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korean Daewoo Electronics Co and Brazilian manufacturer Cineral said they will form a joint-venture to produce microwaves, stereos and VCRs in Brazil as of this year.</p>
<p>&quot;Daewoo plans to produce microwaves in Brazil in the first half of 1997, and stereos and VCRs as of the second semester,&quot; said a spokesman for the companies.</p>
<p>Officials from Cineral and Daewoo will officially announce the deal and disclose further details at a news conference on April 17 at 1100 local/1400 GMT.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
